<title>FRANCE: Iran buys 50,000 tonnes barley - traders.</title>
<headline>Iran buys 50,000 tonnes barley - traders.</headline>
<dateline>PARIS 1997-06-25</dateline>
<text>
<p>Iran on Wednesday bought 50,000 tonnes of barley at $127 to $128 per tonne fob, European grain traders said.</p>
<p>The deal, which confirms earlier market speculation, is for barley to be shipped in October from optional origins.</p>
<p>Traders said the barley had been sold at a tender via a private intermediary.</p>
